  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "My profession",
     "texto": [
      "In these examples, **работать** expresses the profession with the instrumental, without a preposition: **Я работаю врачом** (I work as a doctor), **Он работает учителем** (he works as a teacher). In the present you can also identify someone with the nominative: **Я врач** (I am a doctor).",
      "To ask, you say **Кем ты работаешь?**, with **кем**, the instrumental of **кто**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "What you want to be",
     "texto": [
      "To say what you want to become, **стать** takes the instrumental: **Я хочу стать врачом** (I want to be a doctor). With **хотеть быть** the instrumental is also used: **Кем ты хочешь быть?** (what do you want to be?).",
      "In the examples in this lesson, **врач** forms **врачом** (with **-ом**) and **учитель**, which ends in **-ь**, forms **учителем** (with **-ем**)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
